  "about": "Act 1 regular route exposure profile (PK-M1-51). Day types are 24 hours split over atlas maps (data/world/atlas_maps.json sediment grades); weeks follow the act 1 beats (progression_and_pacing.md 2.3, act1_borderstone.md 1.2); optional days are taken with the regular route's share (17.1: about six in ten) and replaced by the fill day otherwise. Intake follows catalog_consumables_magitools.md 2.2 and 2.4: a field day may bring one tainted portion (light +1, mid +3), crystal potions from week 7 (T2, +0.2 a dose), and half the runs wear one light-patterned piece (untreated grey wolf hide) in weeks 2 to 5, put on in the engine as a real patterned item. The player levels by week follow the expected levels of progression_and_pacing.md 2.3 (tier 1 from level 10, week 7). The intake is sized so the gross taint of the act lands near the doors budget of thousand_doors.md 6.2 (about 15 blockage in act 1, at 4 taint a point).",
